1 REM FBCS SEG-0522
2 REM CLAIM A-9.2.2-TR136B
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 9.2.2 l.4522-4526, 12.1.4 l.8805-8807: two EXTERNAL units declare the same SUB; the CALL in the detached-handler of
5 REM each one is checked against the declare-statement of ITS unit, not against the line of the other unit.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB A, B
20 CALL A
30 CALL B
40 END
100 EXTERNAL SUB A
110 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB LOG
120 WHEN EXCEPTION USE H
130   CAUSE EXCEPTION 1
140 END WHEN
150 HANDLER H
160   CALL LOG("A", EXTYPE)
170 END HANDLER
180 END SUB
200 EXTERNAL SUB B
210 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB LOG
220 WHEN EXCEPTION USE H
230   CAUSE EXCEPTION 2
240 END WHEN
250 HANDLER H
260   CALL LOG("B", EXTYPE)
270 END HANDLER
280 END SUB
300 EXTERNAL SUB LOG(Q$, T)
310 PRINT Q$; T
320 END SUB
